invariant: INV-14
file: handshake_post.h
catches: unit
reason: a raw or ca client presents a kept ticket whose trust its
  configuration no longer holds, so a device keeps resuming the tickets of
  a server key it rotated away, for up to seven days.
  test/session_ticket_tests.h's rows with the issuing key in neither slot
  require CH_EINVAL before a byte is sent.

--- old
    if (!hspost_trust_holds(cfg, &saved->ticket)) {
        return 0;
    }
--- new
